          "number": 2,
          "letter": "",
          "english": "It was __(28)__ observed that the left side of the brain was more active during deep sleep. When the researchers repeated the laboratory experiment on the second and third nights they found the left hemisphere could not be stimulated in the same way during deep sleep. The researchers explained that the study demonstrated when we are in a __(29)__ environment the brain partly remains alert so that humans can defend themselves against any __(30)__ danger.",
          "chinese": "研究人员特别观察到，在深度睡眠期间，大脑左侧更加活跃。当研究人员在第二晚和第三晚重复进行实验室实验时，他们发现，在深度睡眠期间，左半球无法以同样的方式受到刺激。研究人员解释说，这项研究表明，当我们处于陌生环境中时，大脑会部分保持警觉，以便人类能够保护自己免受任何潜在危险。",
